WEBVTT

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:12.130
Shino-chan, is that a cherry blossom?

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:13.860
How elegant.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.940
Yup. We should go flower viewing some time.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.170
Great idea.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:22.500
I'll ask Dejima-san to prepare lunch boxes for us.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.420
Tsuda, what do you think?

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:26.920
Can you let me out, please?

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.200
Not allowed~

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.510
Why not?!

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:31.020
Because its so cute.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:32.580
That's nonsense!

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:11.960
It sure is crowded in the library.

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:13.650
No place for two people to sit.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:17.780
Um, this isn't a good idea.

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:19.990
Y-You think so?

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:23.050
If we sit like this they won't know if you're inside.

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:24.620
You just made it worse!

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:31.680
Recently, the Student Council members have been reading mystery novels.

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:37.400
I wish I was a detective.

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:40.260
Haha, did you enjoy the books that much?

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:43.660
Let's go.

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:45.100
Huh? Go where?

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:48.730
A mystery travel tour sponsored by the Shichijou group?

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:50.080
That does sound interesting.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:54.030
Is three days and two nights good for you?

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:54.980
Sure.

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:57.130
Our family is very large.

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:59.750
It won't matter if I go for three nights.

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:01.680
No, it's three days and two nights.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:06.930
Well, I will be staying at Taka-kun's place the night before.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:10.120
Ah, it's snowing.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.470
Greetings everyone.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:24.640
I am Dejima, your hostess for the mystery tour.

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:27.570
We will not disclose our destination due to nature of the tour.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.710
Though we have a long journey ahead of us,

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:31.640
please relax and enjoy yourselves.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.690
I can't see the road ahead.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:35.840
Just like our life.

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.650
That's not us at all.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:43.030
You're right, everyone should have a future goal at this age.

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:44.910
Very true.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:45.660
That's right.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.620
Uh...g-g-goals...

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:55.060
I'm guessing from the time and the weather,

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:58.670
our destination is in the north-east?

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:03.350
I guess not knowing the destination is also part of the fun.

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:04.170
True.

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:08.850
President?

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.830
I feel dizzy... a bit.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:15.000
Well you were looking at a map while in a bus.

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:16.860
In saying that you are very relaxed.

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:20.950
Why are you taking off your socks?

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.990
Note: Referencing economy class of the
aircraft, cramped so legs start hurting.
I heard about "Economy Class Syndrome".

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:26.380
If you stay in the same position for a long time

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:29.380
It could cause your blood to clot, causing an arrhythmia.

00:04:29.550 --> 00:04:31.350
Taking my socks off could help to prevent it.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:34.520
That sounds terrifying! I'll take them off too!

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:37.760
This girl must be trying to take off her underwear.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:41.100
Now time for the first game!

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:42.010
Where did she come from?

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.420
Without using any tools.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:47.760
Can you divide this bottle of juice evenly?

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.830
One person pours the juice into the cup.

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:53.600
Then the other person chooses that cup, right?

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:58.480
We could use the Minimization Algorithm to figure this out too.

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:03.350
I also want to say that one person drinks all of it and the other drinks their pee.

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:07.370
Bad idea, I'll leave the more serious answers.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:13.410
I know it's called a mystery tour, but it's really stressful not being able to look outside.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:16.400
Taka-nii. If you aren't too busy, can you take a photo?

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:21.460
Uh-oh, my camera is out of battery.

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:23.900
Anyone have a camera?

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:26.340
I have one.

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:33.410
I bought a multipurpose camera to use with multipurpose holes.

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:36.280
Do you think an opportunity to use this will come up on this trip?

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:48.200
This is so good, forgetting my age. I feel like a student again.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:49.490
That's great!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:52.240
My student days were fantastic.

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:54.700
Female high school students are the best!

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.820
I feel there is hidden meaning behind her words.

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:03.750
What happened? It suddenly stopped.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.960
The engine seems to have broken down.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.630
Oh, that's not good.

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:09.500
Oh no!

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:12.100
Everyone, please look over there!

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:14.450
There is a mansion over there.

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:15.540
Let's go check it out.

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:17.350
Oh, this kind of story.

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.600
I am the owner of this house.

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:28.110
It's too dangerous to be outside in this cold.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.940
You can all stay here.

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:32.570
Wasn't he the bus driver just now?

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:34.790
We are lacking in actors.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:38.430
There is also a large bath here. Please feel free to use it.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.410
Large bath?

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:43.170
It'll be nice to stretch our legs in there.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:46.490
If you stretch your legs in the bathtub, you can step on their "gas pedal".

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:47.670
Don't do that in the bath.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.430
Don't do that out of the bath either!

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:54.120
Man, long bus rides really take it out of you.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:59.080
You are
the culprit.

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.560
So I'm meant to play the culprit?
You are
the culprit.

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:04.570
You are
the culprit.
So I'm meant to play the culprit?

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.320
What's going to happen next?

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:10.360
My panties were stolen while we were in the bath!

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:12.200
This is just too much!

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:21.410
That's it, I'm not gonna stay around an underwear thief!

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:23.420
I'm going back to my room!

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:29.880
Someone stop me! I just triggered a flag!

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:34.550
Alright, let's start the investigation.

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:35.640
I'm up?

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.740
What did the stolen panties look like?

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:41.920
Other people look for clues, pervert.

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:44.980
You should look into everyone's alibis.

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:46.210
Good idea.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:49.010
I was in the bath with the president.

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:50.440
It happened around that time.

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.380
I was with Big Sis.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.700
I was with Milady.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:57.780
I was alone in my room.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.000
I don't have an alibi!

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.950
No, I don't think you're the culprit.

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:08.050
You're only upset that it was Shino's panties that were stolen. How sad.

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:10.130
That is not true at all!

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:14.370
Taka-kun, can we sleep together tonight?

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:16.510
Eh?! You can't do that!

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.270
These events have made me scared though.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:22.700
And I don't think you will be targeted again.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.800
What are you talking about?

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:27.520
As long as my dark eyes are watching,

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.090
this is absolutely not allowed!

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:32.880
So, I just have to make your eyes look away?

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:36.180
I will not be defeated by pleasure!

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:38.160
Can you both please stop.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:43.010
Uh, President. You're going through a lot, right?

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:44.350
You're too stiff towards me.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:47.890
This isn't the school, we are in private.

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:51.010
You shouldn't call me president, please call me by my name.

00:08:57.010 --> 00:09:01.410
When I hold this pose, my hand is on my breast.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:02.670
Uh?

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:04.390
I wonder why that is.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:09.710
If I place my hand here, does
it give off a weird impression?

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:11.790
Hurry off to bed now, President.

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:15.730
Screaming?

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:17.780
Did something else happen?

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.080
Kotomi!

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:28.170
My panties were also stolen.

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:34.190
So Tsuda-kun is no longer a suspect.

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:37.140
After all, stealing your little sister's panties is very perverted.

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:39.180
Oh, right...

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:43.410
Both stolen underwear incidents happened consecutively.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:45.180
Who could this culprit be?

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:54.170
How does it taste?

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:55.950
Delicious!

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:59.510
Aria is really skilled with knives and forks.

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:02.880
I think of my father and always remember.

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:05.930
That children were to mimic what their parents were doing. I was raised right.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.960
This is too much for dinner time!

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:16.970
This is..

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:18.970
A clue?!

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:21.290
Is this written in code?

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:22.470
I've solved it!

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:27.050
It's referring to when the three hands of a clock converge. In our case, that will be midnight!

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:30.480
And H must be a bra, as in H cup.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:33.190
The target will have: a H cup?

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:36.650
So scary.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:38.150
So scary!

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:41.920
What can I say to make this situation better?

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:46.960
It's going to be midnight soon.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.290
I wonder what will happen.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:50.630
Tsuda-kun.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:55.920
I am so scared, let me lean on you.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.770
Because my bra unhooks from the front.

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:02.240
Oh, this way it won't be unhooked.

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:03.930
I'm getting used to this.

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:06.040
Power failure?!

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:11.300
Am I supposed to do something now as the culprit?

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:18.220
Although it is not an H cup, I didn't expect it to be hard.

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:19.890
Hard with a capital H.

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:22.450
They're not hard, I'm as soft as a marshmallow!

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:24.530
The third victim has been claimed.

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:27.790
Everyone, to prevent any more incidents,

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.460
Let's move our futons into one room.

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:34.710
It's a western house but they have futons?

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:38.380
But I can't sleep well without wearing underwear.

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:40.470
I will lend you one of mine.

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:41.720
So cold.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:44.720
The bra is too big for me.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.470
The truth is clear.

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:51.640
The culprit...

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:54.730
is among us.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:56.170
It is not me!

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:58.080
Um, not you, um...

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:02.780
This letter appeared in my room.

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:07.300
The culprit wrote this to accuse me of the crime,

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:09.160
But it's a bluff!

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:11.910
The culprit: must be a female to enter the female bath.

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:15.150
The culprit: must be a pervert for stealing my sister's striped panties.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:18.530
The culprit: must know Shichijou-senpai's cup size.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:22.420
And finally: must have the ability to steal the bra Hagimura was wearing.

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.630
Dejima-san, it was you!

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:28.430
Wonderful work.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.480
Perfect reasoning.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:36.870
Now take the rope out,

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:38.760
and tie me up.

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:41.900
You don't feel too bad about it all.

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:48.550
Thank you for your work.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:49.990
My pleasure.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:52.490
Your reasoning was fascinating.

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:55.380
Do you really want to be a detective?

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:57.250
I was just having fun.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:57.260
But it did make you look pretty cool.
I was just having fun.

00:12:57.260 --> 00:13:00.000
But it did make you look pretty cool.

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:08.000
When can I get my underwear back?

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:16.240
Thank you for the meal!

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.390
Red bean bread is delicious.

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:21.120
Cream bread is delicious.

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:24.550
This bread has two flavors.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:28.680
I see, it lets you enjoy two flavors with one bread.

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.380
It's just like breast milk.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:33.810
Is that true?

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:35.040
Don't look at me.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:41.520
Today, we will have a Community report meeting.

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:44.160
The rules are:

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.920
This Student Council holds the fate of the Community.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:48.670
We really get a feeling of dominance.

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:50.800
Your dark side is coming out.

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:52.380
That's right!

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:55.310
What our students need are:

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:57.810
Passionate red and pure white.

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:59.380
It is the pink spirit!

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:00.940
Don't mix them together.

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:02.680
Let's get started.

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:04.440
Whoever's up first, come in.

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:06.340
Why is Furuya-san here?

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:10.810
Our teacher was sick today.

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:13.200
Everyone at the University got sick too.

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.860
Furuya-san, are you okay?

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:18.090
Well, I have a magic shield.

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:18.720
What are you a child?

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:20.490
Shield!

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:21.870
Can we go in?

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:23.800
Please enter.

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:25.350
Excuse me.

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:28.590
I am the head of the Robotics Club, Todoroki.

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:32.220
Our current security is a fingerprint lock.

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:36.350
But fingerprints can also be forged.

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:41.230
So I developed a system that cannot be forged.

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:43.460
Examination Security.

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:45.080
Did you really think this was a good idea?

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.030
Why is the hand...

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:47.750
At least use only one finger!

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:50.360
Can lubricant be used?

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:52.280
Good job!

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:54.120
Hooray!

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:56.400
That score is too high.

00:14:56.400 --> 00:14:59.290
I think the originality is worthy of praise.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:00.370
Agreed.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:03.110
Well it's not completely original.

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.760
I briefly watched a DVD earlier.

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:09.630
Deducting points!

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:11.760
I am Hata from the Newspaper club.

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:14.950
The content of our activities is clear to everyone.

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:18.390
Every month, I publish an Ousai Academy report.

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:22.270
By the way, this is the newspaper to be posted tomorrow.

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:27.150
Food for Autumn. I recommend the meat dishes in the cafeteria.

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:29.120
There is a typo there.
Note: Pun between words Nikushoku and Nikuyoku.
Eat your meat and having your meat eaten.

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:31.970
Eh, this is not a typo. It's delicious.

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:33.410
Thankfully we found this error before posting.
Eh, this is not a typo. It's delicious.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:34.910
Thankfully we found this error before posting.

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:37.270
I am Igarashi from the Chorus group.

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:40.040
We recently won the championship.

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:42.760
I saw, It was beautiful.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.570
Indeed, you were quite good.

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:49.010
Beautiful? I mean...

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:51.560
I just sing with the rest of the group.

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:56.110
It's quite arousing to hear dirty words spoken with a pure voice, isn't it?

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:57.150
That's right.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.930
Occasionally you could let these end nicely!

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:01.800
We are the Film Club.

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:04.500
You all gave us a lot of help for our movie.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.090
Thank you very much.

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:07.440
Thanks.

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:12.300
Thanks to your help, we won the competition, and our club also received high praise.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:13.950
That is really great.

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:15.820
Yeah, great.

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:18.630
What is with your tone, Kenji?

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:22.670
Don't be so stiff. We're friends, aren't we?

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:24.370
This is meant to be a serious meeting.

00:16:25.110 --> 00:16:27.870
Come on club president, say something. You're the producer after all.

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:31.060
I let the the director play freely. It's how we do things at the club.

00:16:31.430 --> 00:16:34.510
Yes, that's true, you understand me.

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:38.980
And we are not in the kind of relationship where we scold each other.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:44.610
The dishes from the Pottery Club are really beautiful.

