00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:49.580
Uomi, you've caught a cold? Are you okay?

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:52.330
It has been cold recently.

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:56.100
After all, my air conditioner at home is broken. We haven't been able to stay warm.

00:19:56.550 --> 00:20:00.590
What does Tsuda's air conditioner being broken and Uomi's cold have to do with each other?

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:05.870
I can recognize my big sister’s voice.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:12.600
And he immediately recognized that it was me talking.

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:15.480
Why can you recognize Uomi's voice so easily?

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:17.610
Well, I won't say anything.

00:22:00.200 --> 00:22:01.460
Tsuda.

00:22:02.610 --> 00:22:04.460
What are you doing here?

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:05.680
Let's go.

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:06.970
I have something to tell you.

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:11.470
Although I have seen this view countless times,

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:13.270
I'm never bored by it.

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:17.730
I really love this school.

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:26.920
Tsuda, do you remember?

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:29.160
That spring day,

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:31.620
we met right here.

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:35.410
I was very strict with you at the time. Sorry about that.

00:22:36.930 --> 00:22:39.790
Maybe I stared at you that day,

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:42.950
not just because your tie was shabby.

00:22:45.830 --> 00:22:46.730
Maybe…

00:22:48.370 --> 00:22:50.680
No, I will say it properly.

00:22:51.080 --> 00:22:53.360
There will be no dirty jokes this time.

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:55.140
I promise.

00:22:55.140 --> 00:22:56.640
I will say it seriously.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:57.860
I...

00:22:58.830 --> 00:23:00.430
I...

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:02.730
Why do you hesitate?

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:03.780
But…

00:23:03.780 --> 00:23:05.650
Gather your courage.

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:10.090
Is he the kind of person who will play with other girls' hearts?

00:23:10.090 --> 00:23:11.410
No!

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:13.660
Tsuda is not like that!

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:16.420
If you recognize each other's excellence,

00:23:16.930 --> 00:23:19.210
then you have to express your true intentions.

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:21.170
Why do you hesitate?

00:23:26.170 --> 00:23:30.180
So embarrassing!

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:31.950
No need to be shy!

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:33.950
It's too embarrassing!

00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:37.820
President, what are you doing?

00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:41.570
The principal is substituting for me.

00:23:41.570 --> 00:23:43.060
Thank you very much.

00:23:46.140 --> 00:23:47.660
Why are you trying to escape?

00:23:47.660 --> 00:23:48.820
I can't do it!

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:51.020
You have to be true to your feelings!

00:23:51.580 --> 00:23:52.570
I can't do it!

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:55.910
Denying your true intentions like this,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.370
is equivalent to denying his existence!

00:24:02.100 --> 00:24:03.230
I'll do it.

00:24:03.590 --> 00:24:04.460
Very good.

00:24:24.190 --> 00:24:25.430
Tsuda.

00:24:25.670 --> 00:24:26.440
Yes..?

00:24:28.320 --> 00:24:29.400
Is...

00:24:30.450 --> 00:24:31.440
What is it?

00:24:34.450 --> 00:24:37.200
Is that a bulge in your pants?

00:24:40.450 --> 00:24:45.330
Ah, sorry! Tsuda, sorry!

00:24:50.020 --> 00:24:53.430
Why couldn't you convey your true feelings?

00:24:54.820 --> 00:24:56.280
You like him, don't you?

00:25:04.040 --> 00:25:06.350
I blame puberty.
